WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 20]

01:52.350 --> 01:52.980
The Heavenly Pass Spear!

01:53.200 --> 01:54.210
Senior, no!

01:54.640 --> 01:55.620
If someone dies here,

01:55.680 --> 01:56.130
we'll also...

02:01.560 --> 02:01.900
I...

02:02.870 --> 02:03.380
What...

02:03.510 --> 02:04.290
You actually caught

02:04.310 --> 02:05.380
my spear tip using only two fingers.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.180
I have seen the Spear Deity

02:08.080 --> 02:09.340
and his spear.

02:10.280 --> 02:10.980
Your spear

02:11.960 --> 02:13.010
can't even compare in the slightest.

02:33.870 --> 02:35.010
Behold, my Surging Dragon Shift.

02:35.470 --> 02:36.570
If tomorrow on the battlefield you and I encounter

02:36.750 --> 02:37.450
Ye Dingzhi,

02:37.870 --> 02:38.890
I will use my Surging Dragon Shift.

02:39.080 --> 02:40.470
[Sikong Changfeng of Xueyue City]
You must learn to use

02:40.470 --> 02:41.010
the Eighteen-Sword Array to assassinate him.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.380
- Senior! - Senior!

03:27.400 --> 03:28.610
This is as far as I can recall.

03:32.120 --> 03:32.690
Was...

03:33.560 --> 03:34.980
Was that the Spear Deity's Surging Dragon Shift?

03:35.520 --> 03:36.850
The Surging Dragon Shift consists of 33 moves.

03:37.710 --> 03:38.890
I'm not skilled in spear techniques.

03:40.120 --> 03:41.010
These 13 moves

03:41.560 --> 03:42.540
only capture the form,

03:42.910 --> 03:43.820
but not the spirit.

03:44.630 --> 03:46.220
If the Spear Deity had used his spear just now,

03:46.750 --> 03:47.570
you would have been dead

03:48.470 --> 03:49.500
on the first strike.

03:51.190 --> 03:52.130
Who are you?

03:53.080 --> 03:53.940
Anyone who knows the Spear Deity

03:54.190 --> 03:55.130
and can perform the Surging Dragon Shift

03:55.750 --> 03:56.940
is no ordinary martial artist.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.660
I hail not from any notable clan.

03:59.430 --> 04:00.380
I was fortunate enough

04:01.190 --> 04:02.100
to fight alongside the Spear Deity

04:02.150 --> 04:03.340
to stop the Demon Sect.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.940
Can I leave now?

04:07.870 --> 04:08.500
So you were among

04:08.560 --> 04:09.890
those who resisted the Demon Sect's eastern invasion.

04:10.360 --> 04:11.260
I apologize for my disrespect.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.820
[Lu Yuzhai of Wushuang City]
You may pass.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.490
And what if

04:26.950 --> 04:27.850
I had lost?

04:31.950 --> 04:32.460
I merely know

04:32.480 --> 04:33.730
that if I were in Xueyue City right now,

04:35.160 --> 04:37.050
I'd be gazing at snow-capped peaks,

04:37.950 --> 04:39.250
savoring the Beauty of Four Seasons.

04:40.830 --> 04:42.100
Wushuang, peerless under Heaven.

04:42.950 --> 04:45.140
For that, it must have the demeanor of the unrivaled in the world.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.410
Senior.

05:08.070 --> 05:08.700
That is one

05:09.830 --> 05:10.660
terrifying man.

05:11.950 --> 05:12.460
Dan!

05:15.360 --> 05:15.850
Dan,

05:16.480 --> 05:17.780
the disciples lying in ambush outside the gate

05:17.920 --> 05:19.050
failed to poison Su Changhe.

05:19.310 --> 05:20.220
It seems he was well prepared

05:20.360 --> 05:21.100
and broke through.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.490
Even with all my preparations,

05:24.510 --> 05:26.100
are you still stronger than me,

05:27.390 --> 05:28.660
Su Changhe?

05:29.070 --> 05:29.490
Dan,

05:30.270 --> 05:31.290
what should we do next?

05:32.040 --> 05:32.540
Must we

05:33.510 --> 05:34.580
just admit defeat?

05:36.560 --> 05:37.340
Admit defeat?

05:39.000 --> 05:41.020
I will never yield to the Nameless.

05:41.950 --> 05:43.540
Su Changhe insists on going his own way.

05:44.630 --> 05:46.220
Now, he is all alone.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.490
Assemble all our forces

05:49.270 --> 05:50.580
to trap him!

05:51.040 --> 05:51.370
Yes, sir.

05:52.630 --> 05:53.730
Too late for that.

06:07.190 --> 06:08.730
You're determined to leave me

06:08.750 --> 06:10.140
no chance of survival.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.780
How disheartening.

06:30.360 --> 06:30.900
Stop right there!

06:40.500 --> 06:41.580
[Wushuang]

06:45.870 --> 06:46.460
Let him through.

06:46.950 --> 06:48.780
Lu Yuzhai's intimidation was momentary.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.980
Once the initial shock wears off,

06:51.390 --> 06:51.980
he will see through

06:52.000 --> 06:52.930
my disguise.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.220
And it will be

06:54.270 --> 06:55.370
much harder for me

06:55.950 --> 06:57.370
to get close to Wushuang City.

07:02.120 --> 07:02.540
Senior

07:02.560 --> 07:04.100
is unsettled

07:04.720 --> 07:06.290
after the crushing defeat.

07:07.040 --> 07:07.490
Senior?

07:08.390 --> 07:08.850
Senior.

07:08.900 --> 07:09.660
Quiet!

07:14.040 --> 07:15.370
He was one of those who took part

07:15.430 --> 07:16.410
in resisting the Demon Sect's eastern invasion.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.780
He fought alongside the Spear Deity.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.220
He could perform 13 moves perfectly

07:22.720 --> 07:24.290
after seeing them only a few times.

07:27.080 --> 07:27.680
Heed my command.

07:28.560 --> 07:29.850
Sound the drum and send a message to the checkpoint.

07:30.120 --> 07:30.730
Stop that person

07:31.160 --> 07:31.980
at all costs.

07:32.310 --> 07:32.610
Understood.

07:34.120 --> 07:34.460
You.

07:35.070 --> 07:35.780
Take the Disciple Path

07:36.040 --> 07:37.160
to Lunwu Hall and have Elder Jian

07:37.160 --> 07:38.040
send out the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts

07:38.070 --> 07:38.930
to seize that man outside the city.

07:39.390 --> 07:39.780
Yes.

08:04.750 --> 08:05.290
That sound...

08:06.480 --> 08:07.140
It's the sound of war drums.

08:09.510 --> 08:10.340
All of you, step back!

08:10.590 --> 08:11.140
You there.

08:11.140 --> 08:11.660
Move back.

08:12.360 --> 08:12.980
Move back, all of you!

08:16.270 --> 08:16.780
Senior.

08:17.430 --> 08:18.610
The Disciple Path, twice as fast

08:18.680 --> 08:19.220
as the main roads,

08:19.430 --> 08:20.460
is reserved solely for the direct disciples

08:20.560 --> 08:21.100
of Wushuang City.

08:21.510 --> 08:22.410
And the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts.

08:22.920 --> 08:24.660
Is this not a bit too much?

08:25.920 --> 08:26.460
Too much?

08:27.430 --> 08:28.170
If only my authority

08:28.240 --> 08:28.980
extended further.

08:29.950 --> 08:30.980
I would've had Elder Jian himself

08:31.040 --> 08:31.700
lead the attack.

08:33.620 --> 08:37.220
[Jian Shanyue of Wushuang City]

08:58.200 --> 08:58.940
Luo Ge.

09:00.440 --> 09:01.730
Your sword tip is three inches too low,

09:02.480 --> 09:03.940
and your sword is raised two tenths of a measure too slowly.

09:12.910 --> 09:13.940
[Luo Ge, One of the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts]
Thank you, Master Jian.

09:19.750 --> 09:20.940
[Xiu Ru, One of the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts]
Next time, he won't strike

09:20.960 --> 09:21.820
with that form again.

09:22.840 --> 09:24.220
My advice to you

09:24.360 --> 09:25.220
won't be of much use.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.130
What you should consider

09:27.670 --> 09:30.060
is why he used that form just now.

09:30.630 --> 09:32.820
Swordsmanship is divided into technique and method.

09:33.440 --> 09:34.980
Over-pursuit of technique leads

09:35.510 --> 09:38.370
to endless battles of attrition.

09:38.660 --> 09:40.420
[Jia Zhou, One of the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts]

09:40.420 --> 09:42.460
[Ye Wuxiu, One of the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts]

09:46.440 --> 09:47.060
I'll remember that.

09:49.200 --> 09:49.820
Master Jian,

09:50.630 --> 09:51.610
why do you warn him?

09:53.630 --> 09:54.340
Xiu Ru,

09:54.870 --> 09:55.580
you can win,

09:56.270 --> 09:57.300
yet you don't.

09:57.840 --> 09:58.820
You want to wait

09:58.870 --> 09:59.650
for the perfect moment.

10:00.150 --> 10:02.060
But there's no such thing as a perfect moment in this world.

10:02.630 --> 10:03.460
- A person in the martial world - I...

10:03.550 --> 10:04.980
must gamble with their life.

10:05.030 --> 10:07.370
Where there's gambling, there's risk.

10:07.600 --> 10:09.610
If you refuse to take any risk,

10:10.320 --> 10:10.890
you will

10:10.910 --> 10:12.340
keep losing opportunities,

10:12.440 --> 10:13.530
losing chance after chance.

10:13.790 --> 10:15.610
In the end, your opponent will find your flaw

10:16.000 --> 10:17.370
and defeat you with one strike.

10:21.390 --> 10:22.300
I've been enlightened.

10:25.510 --> 10:25.980
Elder.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.820
Lu Yuzhai has sent a messenger

10:28.030 --> 10:28.770
saying there's something urgent

10:28.960 --> 10:29.820
and requesting help from Lunwu Hall﻿.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.850
Who does Lu Yuzhai think he is?

10:34.390 --> 10:35.980
He dares to issue orders to Lunwu Hall﻿

10:35.980 --> 10:37.200
just because he's the City Lord's

10:37.200 --> 10:37.920
principal disciple?

10:38.390 --> 10:38.890
Tell him to get lost.

10:40.840 --> 10:42.010
Lu Yuzhai's martial skills are mediocre,

10:42.670 --> 10:43.770
but he is always exceptionally shrewd

10:44.510 --> 10:45.420
in dealing with people.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.010
He wouldn't come to Lunwu Hall﻿

10:47.030 --> 10:48.010
for no reason.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.010
Speak.

10:50.790 --> 10:51.300
What's the matter?

10:53.840 --> 10:54.610
Come here and deliver your message.

10:54.910 --> 10:55.530
There are no outsiders.

10:58.480 --> 10:59.010
Elder Jian.

11:00.870 --> 11:01.800
Senior discovered someone

11:01.800 --> 11:02.830
trying to enter Wushuang City

11:02.830 --> 11:03.540
with malicious intent.

11:03.790 --> 11:04.770
We've already sounded the prohibition drum

11:05.000 --> 11:06.130
and stopped all checkpoints from letting anyone in.

11:06.630 --> 11:07.980
But fearing that person might storm the city,

11:08.550 --> 11:09.060
we hope

11:09.480 --> 11:10.660
Lunwu Hall﻿ can send out

11:10.660 --> 11:11.970
the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿ to intercept.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.610
How presumptuous!

11:14.320 --> 11:15.460
Since when is Lunwu Hall﻿ responsible

11:15.510 --> 11:16.300
for guarding the gates?

11:16.670 --> 11:17.980
Besides, he discovered him already.

11:18.090 --> 11:19.040
Why didn't he stop him?

11:19.360 --> 11:20.490
Senior failed to stop him

11:21.320 --> 11:21.820
and was defeated.

11:23.980 --> 11:25.010
I knew it.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.280
If anything good happens,

11:26.280 --> 11:27.600
it never falls to us.

11:27.680 --> 11:29.050
He'd steal all the credit.

11:29.630 --> 11:30.130
Wuxiu.

11:31.030 --> 11:31.610
Behave.

11:33.080 --> 11:33.530
I

11:33.790 --> 11:34.420
misspoke.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.890
What's that person's identity?

11:38.360 --> 11:38.730
Unknown.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.180
He was wearing a face veil

11:40.240 --> 11:41.180
and carrying a long sword.

11:42.270 --> 11:43.700
But when facing Senior,

11:44.240 --> 11:45.460
he used a set of spear techniques.

11:45.910 --> 11:46.530
Spear techniques?

11:47.000 --> 11:47.770
Which spear techniques?

11:48.910 --> 11:49.580
Senior said

11:49.910 --> 11:50.610
it was the Surging Dragon Shift.

11:52.790 --> 11:53.580
Surging Dragon Shift?

11:54.390 --> 11:55.100
What?

11:57.840 --> 11:58.530
Is he certain?

11:59.550 --> 12:00.890
That person admitted it himself.

12:01.200 --> 12:03.220
He said he learned it after witnessing the Spear Deity Sikong Changfeng﻿

12:03.240 --> 12:04.220
use it.

12:04.480 --> 12:05.130
I remember it.

12:05.270 --> 12:06.180
It really is the Surging Dragon Shift.

12:08.550 --> 12:10.460
Could he be sent by Xueyue City﻿?

12:24.270 --> 12:25.850
[The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿ have all set out.]
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

12:26.440 --> 12:27.340
have all set out.

12:30.480 --> 12:30.980
Good.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.940
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts are said

12:33.270 --> 12:34.650
to have mastered Elder Jian's true teachings.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.370
With their help,

12:36.930 --> 12:38.610
we'll surely defeat the veiled man.

12:38.750 --> 12:39.420
Defeat, my foot!

12:41.200 --> 12:41.890
Those four useless fools?

12:44.870 --> 12:45.980
How strong can those four be?

12:46.750 --> 12:47.730
That man was unbelievably strong just now.

12:48.870 --> 12:49.940
He's a swordsman,

12:50.480 --> 12:51.730
but with a casual swing of my spear,

12:52.030 --> 12:52.850
he shattered it

12:52.910 --> 12:53.730
to pieces.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.700
Do you understand the mastery he possesses?

12:56.440 --> 12:57.890
He's an expert among experts!

12:59.750 --> 13:00.850
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

13:01.550 --> 13:02.650
aren't even worthy to serve beneath his feet.

13:03.200 --> 13:03.870
Then why

13:03.870 --> 13:04.940
send them?

13:06.750 --> 13:07.770
If I alone lose,

13:08.510 --> 13:10.340
Lunwu Hall﻿ will make a big deal

13:10.480 --> 13:11.600
to humiliate my master.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.580
If the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

13:13.600 --> 13:14.700
suffer the same defeat,

13:15.150 --> 13:16.340
it'll be their disgrace.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.130
And if they lose,

13:18.630 --> 13:20.130
Elder Jian will engage that man himself.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.730
So your ultimate goal

13:24.150 --> 13:25.730
is to force Elder Jian to stop that man.

13:33.720 --> 13:34.460
But can Elder Jian

13:35.600 --> 13:36.420
win against him?

13:46.720 --> 13:48.580
I sent all those people to kill you,

13:49.390 --> 13:50.010
how are you still...

13:50.870 --> 13:52.460
I had to leave to lure you into action.

13:54.440 --> 13:56.300
We've brought down the three families.

13:56.860 --> 13:57.650
Do you really think

13:57.910 --> 13:59.450
you're stronger than Su Jinhui,

13:59.450 --> 14:01.060
Xie Ba, and the others?

14:01.670 --> 14:02.460
Weren't you

14:03.240 --> 14:04.340
all poisoned?

14:05.240 --> 14:05.980
How foolish.

14:06.790 --> 14:08.460
You actually believe you could poison the Poisonous Blossom﻿.

14:08.750 --> 14:09.940
Your poison is useless against me.

14:10.630 --> 14:11.340
And my poison

14:11.960 --> 14:13.060
can cure everyone's poison.

14:13.840 --> 14:14.490
It seems

14:15.240 --> 14:16.460
the Mu family is seriously underestimated.

14:18.790 --> 14:19.820
Let me handle this, Changhe.

14:20.910 --> 14:21.490
Patience.

14:26.360 --> 14:27.010
Su Luandan,

14:27.910 --> 14:28.650
why did you betray me?

14:29.480 --> 14:30.220
I followed you

14:31.480 --> 14:33.340
hoping to become head of the Su family﻿.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.580
But you handed the position to Su Muyu!

14:38.000 --> 14:38.610
Imbecile.

14:40.080 --> 14:41.460
Who do you think you are,

14:42.240 --> 14:44.060
to imagine yourself above Su Muyu?

14:44.960 --> 14:46.580
You were never even part of the Su family﻿!

14:51.510 --> 14:52.460
I had no intention to kill you,

14:53.790 --> 14:54.820
but what you said now

14:54.840 --> 14:55.940
compels me to end you.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.370
You were once

14:58.390 --> 14:59.490
one of the most important members of The Other Shore﻿.

15:00.750 --> 15:01.700
Here in The Other Shore﻿,

15:02.670 --> 15:03.980
there is no distinction of family

15:04.030 --> 15:05.180
or Nameless.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.180
Don't tell me you believe

15:08.440 --> 15:09.730
those people joined The Other Shore﻿

15:11.000 --> 15:11.960
for those

15:12.030 --> 15:13.370
ridiculous ideals?

15:13.870 --> 15:14.940
They only believe those old fools

15:15.630 --> 15:16.460
have ruled

15:16.480 --> 15:18.180
the Blood River's laws too long

15:18.630 --> 15:19.770
and are seeking an opportunity

15:20.630 --> 15:21.700
to overthrow them.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.490
The Other Shore﻿

15:24.790 --> 15:26.250
just gave them that chance.

15:27.030 --> 15:27.490
Su Luandan,

15:30.030 --> 15:31.010
you've gone too far.

15:35.360 --> 15:36.580
You can't reach The Other Shore﻿ anymore.

15:37.670 --> 15:39.180
One last question.

15:40.550 --> 15:42.340
Who is the person

15:43.750 --> 15:44.770
behind you?

15:47.440 --> 15:48.340
How do you know?

15:53.000 --> 15:54.730
I was right about you having a backer.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.050
So be it.

15:56.720 --> 15:58.060
I won't bother guessing.

15:59.270 --> 16:00.990
Your death

16:03.670 --> 16:05.300
shall be my answer to him.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.730
Should I charge through right here,

16:30.790 --> 16:31.460
or...

16:39.600 --> 16:40.770
How many checkpoints are left

16:40.910 --> 16:41.850
before Wushuang City?

16:42.670 --> 16:43.370
Is this your first time here?

16:45.030 --> 16:45.770
This is the last one.

16:46.550 --> 16:47.250
Beyond this

16:47.510 --> 16:48.850
is the gate of Wushuang City.

16:49.600 --> 16:50.700
I've come many times,

16:51.630 --> 16:53.220
but this is the first time I've encountered this.

16:53.630 --> 16:54.650
Wushuang City.

16:56.790 --> 16:58.420
Its status declines by the day,

16:58.670 --> 16:59.980
yet its arrogance grows stronger.

17:04.140 --> 17:05.660
Are you here for business too?

17:07.200 --> 17:08.330
Though I'm a merchant,

17:08.920 --> 17:10.700
I deal mostly with martial artists.

17:11.160 --> 17:11.810
One careless step

17:12.680 --> 17:13.700
and I'd lose my head.

17:14.680 --> 17:15.940
I'm a weapons dealer.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.290
There's a Yuexia Smithy in the city.

17:19.070 --> 17:20.140
I ordered a batch of Soul-Chasing Crossbows.

17:20.510 --> 17:21.180
I'm here

17:21.480 --> 17:22.010
to pick them up.

17:22.830 --> 17:23.460
What a coincidence.

17:24.030 --> 17:24.620
So am I.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.250
We're fated to meet.

17:28.550 --> 17:29.090
Indeed.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.400
They're coming!

17:30.480 --> 17:31.140
Someone's arrived!

17:31.590 --> 17:32.650
Finally!

17:39.880 --> 17:40.660
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

17:41.310 --> 17:42.420
of Lunwu Hall.

17:43.030 --> 17:44.460
Are they well-known

17:45.030 --> 17:46.530
in Wushuang City?

17:48.400 --> 17:49.750
Among the younger generation of Lunwu Hall﻿

17:49.750 --> 17:50.660
in Wushuang City,

17:50.660 --> 17:52.220
they are the most formidable four swordsmen.

17:52.880 --> 17:53.530
It's said

17:54.030 --> 17:55.360
Elder Jian specially chose

17:55.360 --> 17:57.270
four young disciples to represent

17:57.720 --> 17:59.390
the four qualities of swordsmanship.

17:59.400 --> 18:02.070
Lightness, heaviness, swiftness, and patience.

18:02.510 --> 18:03.890
He intends to develop

18:03.960 --> 18:05.570
a supreme

18:05.960 --> 18:06.850
sword technique

18:06.920 --> 18:09.060
by observing their growth.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.780
That's why these four

18:11.030 --> 18:12.650
are called the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿.

18:13.750 --> 18:14.740
So that's the story.

18:15.590 --> 18:16.740
I have heard

18:16.750 --> 18:17.610
of Elder Jian's name.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.570
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts

18:21.030 --> 18:22.410
sound intriguing.

18:22.750 --> 18:23.640
- They're here. - At last.

18:23.640 --> 18:24.510
They're here.

18:32.030 --> 18:32.670
What did

18:32.670 --> 18:33.700
that troublemaker look like again?

18:36.160 --> 18:37.060
A sword hung by his waist,

18:37.750 --> 18:38.940
a veil covering his face.

18:39.830 --> 18:40.410
There he is!

18:44.440 --> 18:46.370
Well, that was easy.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.170
The young man in the center,

18:49.160 --> 18:49.810
you stay.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.330
Everyone else, clear out.

18:54.270 --> 18:55.220
Let's go.

18:56.200 --> 18:56.810
Hey,

18:57.270 --> 18:57.980
you caused trouble?

18:58.270 --> 18:58.810
I'll manage.

19:00.070 --> 19:01.500
Please take care of my horse for me.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.090
But...

19:04.750 --> 19:05.170
All right.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.090
Very well.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.980
What's your business in Wushuang City?

19:09.830 --> 19:10.810
I ordered a crossbow.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.810
I'm here to collect it.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.460
But someone said

19:16.030 --> 19:17.460
you came here to cause trouble.

19:18.350 --> 19:19.130
Who said that?

19:20.000 --> 19:21.570
Lu Yuzhai, eldest disciple

19:21.640 --> 19:22.330
of the City Lord.

19:22.920 --> 19:23.810
He blocked my path

19:24.680 --> 19:26.220
and wanted to test my sword.

19:27.160 --> 19:27.810
I refused.

19:29.720 --> 19:32.330
Does that make me a "troublemaker" here?

19:32.750 --> 19:34.220
You refused?

19:36.790 --> 19:37.740
Well, he claimed

19:38.480 --> 19:40.170
you broke his spear.

19:41.070 --> 19:42.330
To break his spear

19:43.640 --> 19:44.940
wouldn't even require my sword.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.060
And us?

19:48.480 --> 19:49.500
Come at me all at once.

19:53.160 --> 19:54.980
How amusing.

19:55.960 --> 19:56.850
Jia Zhou. Ye Wuxiu.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.300
Lightness.

20:10.240 --> 20:10.740
Heaviness.

20:28.240 --> 20:28.780
Swiftness.

20:36.400 --> 20:37.300
Now!

20:45.480 --> 20:46.090
Patience.

20:54.350 --> 20:55.940
Lightness, heaviness, swiftness, and patience.

20:56.200 --> 20:57.540
The four ways of the sword.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.500
Got something to say?

21:03.200 --> 21:04.020
The Way of the Sword

21:04.590 --> 21:06.260
cannot be confined to four mere aspects,

21:07.030 --> 21:08.740
or it will lead to complete defeat

21:09.880 --> 21:11.170
against a genuine master.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.570
What true master?

21:14.270 --> 21:14.890
I am

21:15.790 --> 21:17.460
that true master.

21:28.000 --> 21:30.260
Did your master have you pursue this technique

21:31.310 --> 21:32.810
to seek the way,

21:33.350 --> 21:34.700
or to use you

21:35.510 --> 21:37.060
to seek his own?

21:37.790 --> 21:38.880
Elder Jian knows

21:38.880 --> 21:40.410
these four sword styles

21:41.510 --> 21:43.090
would be shattered

21:43.880 --> 21:45.090
by a true master,

21:46.030 --> 21:47.700
yet he has us study them anyway.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.810
He doesn't intend for us

21:50.680 --> 21:51.130
to achieve mastery,

21:51.750 --> 21:53.060
but to hone his own

21:53.590 --> 21:54.850
through our duels.

21:54.880 --> 21:55.810
Nonsense!

21:58.160 --> 21:59.810
The Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

22:01.510 --> 22:02.300
have been defeated.

22:03.440 --> 22:05.260
And that man didn't even

22:05.260 --> 22:06.260
draw his sword.

22:06.830 --> 22:08.160
Is his swordsmanship

22:08.160 --> 22:09.700
really that great?

22:10.270 --> 22:11.220
Or are

22:11.550 --> 22:12.780
the Four Seekers of the Sword Arts﻿

22:13.400 --> 22:15.330
just empty titles?

22:18.110 --> 22:18.700
Silence!

22:19.240 --> 22:20.130
Not a word from any of you!

22:24.240 --> 22:25.500
I was merely careless.

22:29.110 --> 22:30.650
There's no room for carelessness in the martial world.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.460
Chances to survive

22:33.000 --> 22:34.220
rarely come twice.

22:35.920 --> 22:37.610
When did he take the sword?

22:39.790 --> 22:40.780
Be careful.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.130
Don't let the sword cut you.

22:42.750 --> 22:44.130
This sword is rather sharp.

22:44.830 --> 22:46.410
One careless swipe

22:46.680 --> 22:48.500
might sever your head.

22:51.640 --> 22:52.510
Alas, I still haven't found

22:52.510 --> 22:53.650
anyone worthy of drawing my sword.

23:05.420 --> 23:09.030
[Wushuang Border]

23:09.030 --> 23:10.220
As for us...

23:11.920 --> 23:13.700
If Elder Jian always meant

23:14.830 --> 23:16.260
to use us

23:17.240 --> 23:18.410
to pursue his own path,

23:19.960 --> 23:21.850
then what were all our struggles

23:23.920 --> 23:24.810
and sacrifices for?

23:28.550 --> 23:29.810
We exerted ourselves a lot

23:30.480 --> 23:31.540
in that duel.

23:32.640 --> 23:33.780
It's reasonable to rest here

23:34.480 --> 23:35.650
and recover our strength.

23:39.920 --> 23:41.020
Alert the city!

23:41.480 --> 23:42.540
Someone is trying to breach the gates!

23:43.000 --> 23:43.810
Sound the drums!

23:44.160 --> 23:44.570
Understood.

24:04.240 --> 24:05.410
Who dares

24:05.750 --> 24:07.540
to breach Wushuang City?

24:09.030 --> 24:10.330
I, Zhuo Yue'an,

24:11.110 --> 24:12.780
Young City Lord of the No-Sword City,

24:13.350 --> 24:14.570
challenge Wushuang to a duel.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.260
Challenge Wushuang to a duel?

24:24.640 --> 24:25.650
Me?

24:25.880 --> 24:27.500
No, he is seeking to challenge the sword arts of Wushuang City.

24:29.110 --> 24:30.020
This person is no ordinary visitor.

24:31.350 --> 24:32.060
Come, we will see this person together.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.940
The No-Sword City.

24:46.640 --> 24:48.700
A distant yet familiar name.

24:51.830 --> 24:53.170
I, Zhuo Yue'an,

24:54.000 --> 24:55.500
Young City Lord of the No-Sword City,

24:56.240 --> 24:57.410
challenge Wushuang to a duel.

25:02.030 --> 25:03.300
Does Wushuang City not even

25:03.400 --> 25:05.700
have a single swordsman to accept the challenge?

25:07.750 --> 25:08.330
If that's the case,

25:08.400 --> 25:09.740
better not call it Wushuang City.

25:10.310 --> 25:10.890
Rename it

25:11.160 --> 25:12.410
"Wugui City"!
[*"Wugui" here refers to cowardice.]

25:14.590 --> 25:15.650
Let's make a bet.

25:18.480 --> 25:19.570
You wish to make a bet.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.130
What's the wager?

25:22.440 --> 25:23.740
How long till someone

25:24.000 --> 25:26.060
from Wushuang City steps up to take my challenge?

25:26.640 --> 25:27.220
Very well.

25:28.030 --> 25:29.300
I'll take that bet.

25:29.750 --> 25:31.460
I say I'll call "Wugui City" three times

25:31.920 --> 25:32.780
before anyone answers.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.170
"Wugui City!"

25:35.680 --> 25:36.610
"Wugui City!"

25:37.510 --> 25:38.740
Wugui...

25:39.720 --> 25:40.570
All right. I lost.

25:40.640 --> 25:41.600
I was one word short.

25:42.580 --> 25:46.620
[Peerless Under Heaven]

25:47.200 --> 25:48.540
Jian Shanyue.

25:52.110 --> 25:53.260
It really is you.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.330
You recognize me?

25:55.960 --> 25:57.370
Though you wear a veil

25:57.830 --> 25:59.890
and it's been years

26:00.310 --> 26:01.570
since we first met,

26:02.160 --> 26:03.410
I know

26:03.960 --> 26:05.460
you're that child.

26:07.960 --> 26:10.300
To those who have walked the sword's path for years,

26:10.720 --> 26:12.460
people are like swords.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.020
When I first saw you,

26:14.160 --> 26:16.330
you were the mold of a fine sword.

26:16.790 --> 26:17.740
Now, I see

26:19.030 --> 26:20.850
you've become that sword itself.

26:22.960 --> 26:24.170
The Ancient Azure Sword.

26:24.790 --> 26:26.500
Elder Jian Shanyue of Lunwu Hall,

26:27.070 --> 26:27.980
Wushuang City.

26:29.110 --> 26:29.780
That is me.

26:30.790 --> 26:32.090
You came to challenge the swords of Wushuang.

26:33.160 --> 26:35.220
Does my Ancient Azure Sword suffice

26:35.720 --> 26:37.650
to answer you?

26:39.270 --> 26:40.330
My sword is right here.

26:41.240 --> 26:43.370
But none I've met in Wushuang City today

26:43.920 --> 26:46.170
deserve my sword to be drawn.

26:49.310 --> 26:51.060
Do I not deserve it either?

26:51.640 --> 26:52.610
That depends

26:53.350 --> 26:54.700
on your swordsmanship.

26:56.510 --> 26:57.220
Very well.

26:57.510 --> 26:58.220
Young man.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.330
You have pride.

27:00.070 --> 27:01.460
Just like your father.

27:13.480 --> 27:15.410
You think you can overcome my sword energy with empty sleeves?

27:15.510 --> 27:17.300
You underestimate me.

27:23.640 --> 27:24.740
Sleeves of Spring Breeze?

27:25.110 --> 27:26.300
How do you know that skill?

27:26.720 --> 27:28.060
That technique has long been...

27:28.160 --> 27:29.700
My father taught me.

27:30.680 --> 27:31.810
Was this how

27:32.880 --> 27:33.980
my father defeated you

27:34.000 --> 27:34.810
back then?

27:47.640 --> 27:50.060
Wind hidden in the sleeves, proud as spring breeze.

27:50.510 --> 27:51.850
Your father used it

27:52.200 --> 27:54.020
with such grace and ease.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.780
But your use

27:56.350 --> 27:58.570
feels constrained.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.300
Where is the spring breeze?

28:00.680 --> 28:02.130
What pride do you bear?

28:05.160 --> 28:06.570
Sword Energy: Resounding Thunder!

28:12.070 --> 28:12.700
Master,

28:13.160 --> 28:13.780
the thunder's coming.

28:14.070 --> 28:15.060
Rain's about to fall.

28:15.310 --> 28:16.330
We should return to fetch the umbrellas

28:16.550 --> 28:17.610
and bring in the blankets.

28:17.790 --> 28:18.500
What umbrellas?

28:18.880 --> 28:19.610
This is sword energy.

28:22.030 --> 28:23.610
Such powerful sword energy.

28:26.270 --> 28:28.090
This sword energy rumbles like thunder rolling through the sky.

28:29.270 --> 28:30.020
Who could it be?

28:31.880 --> 28:32.890
Could it be her?

28:34.070 --> 28:34.740
No.

28:35.070 --> 28:36.540
Her sword energy is cold and sharp.

28:37.510 --> 28:38.890
It isn't so bold or unbridled.

28:40.110 --> 28:42.170
Perhaps a swordsman from the Lei Clan?

28:44.000 --> 28:44.700
Whoever it is,

28:45.720 --> 28:47.170
all is fine as long as they're not from Xueyue City.

28:47.960 --> 28:48.660
Master,

28:48.720 --> 28:49.610
what are you muttering about?

28:50.920 --> 28:51.530
Let's go.

28:52.500 --> 28:55.140
♪With all my courage, I forge a shining armor♪

28:55.220 --> 28:57.540
♪This fire inside me can never be put out...♪

28:57.790 --> 28:59.500
A fine sword energy, Resounding Thunder.

28:59.780 --> 29:02.020
♪I swallow all the bitterness to keep my calm♪

29:03.180 --> 29:05.980
♪Though short in height, my ambition is mighty and vast♪

29:06.900 --> 29:08.300
♪Greed and ambition fuel the flames...♪

29:09.000 --> 29:10.610
You want to defeat me without drawing your sword?

29:11.070 --> 29:11.810
Then,

29:11.830 --> 29:13.500
I'll make sure you never draw it again.

29:14.620 --> 29:17.820
♪This battle is mine alone, against myself♪

29:18.720 --> 29:19.300
City Lord.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.810
Who is the visitor?

29:23.160 --> 29:24.090
The No-Sword City.

29:26.110 --> 29:27.610
The No-Sword City?

29:29.880 --> 29:30.700
There is a survivor

29:31.590 --> 29:32.500
after all?

29:32.880 --> 29:33.330
The visitor claims

29:33.440 --> 29:34.890
to be Zhuo Yue'an, Young City Lord

29:35.200 --> 29:35.780
of No-Sword City.

29:39.640 --> 29:40.780
It's that boy.

29:43.550 --> 29:44.460
To think

29:45.880 --> 29:47.500
he survived.

29:48.790 --> 29:50.300
Elder Jian has gone to confront him in battle.

29:50.750 --> 29:52.170
He told me to inform you.

29:54.310 --> 29:55.460
Jian Shanyue

29:56.480 --> 29:57.810
cannot stop that sword.

30:04.160 --> 30:04.780
Thank goodness.

30:06.270 --> 30:08.020
He's not one of those related to Xueyue City.

30:32.880 --> 30:33.810
You have already lost.

30:40.200 --> 30:41.410
Even your father

30:41.510 --> 30:42.570
back then

30:43.030 --> 30:44.780
wouldn't dare speak to me this way!

30:45.400 --> 30:47.410
How many times have you brought up my father now?

30:48.160 --> 30:49.220
Thrice you have mentioned him.

30:51.510 --> 30:52.780
What right, pray tell,

30:53.510 --> 30:55.650
do you have to speak of him?

30:56.200 --> 30:56.700
You...

30:59.680 --> 31:01.330
Don't force me to kill you!

31:07.400 --> 31:08.300
The Shanyue Sword Technique.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.810
At last, I've seen it with my own eyes.

31:11.110 --> 31:12.410
The Shanyue Sword Technique

31:13.310 --> 31:14.570
may not be enough

31:14.570 --> 31:15.740
to handle that Zhuo Yue'an.

31:38.920 --> 31:40.060
You've reached the summit

31:40.680 --> 31:42.170
and seen all other peaks below.

31:42.880 --> 31:45.060
But beyond those peaks lie still higher clouds and sky.

31:45.720 --> 31:46.650
If you halt your progress,

31:47.200 --> 31:48.890
one day, you will inevitably fall from the heights.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.220
Die!

32:03.880 --> 32:04.540
Cease this!

32:13.200 --> 32:14.060
I came here seeking a duel,

32:14.510 --> 32:15.640
and I've finally met

32:15.640 --> 32:17.020
someone worth drawing my sword for.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.370
I am Song Yanhui

32:19.240 --> 32:20.060
of Wushuang City.

32:20.750 --> 32:22.060
Zhuo Yue'an

32:22.880 --> 32:23.780
of the No-Sword City.

32:25.960 --> 32:26.980
The Autumn Water Sword.

32:28.720 --> 32:29.370
Yes.

32:32.480 --> 32:33.980
My father once mentioned you.

32:35.310 --> 32:37.810
Heard you were full of pride in your youth,

32:38.640 --> 32:40.130
believing that wielding your sword

32:40.240 --> 32:41.500
could reach the pinnacle of the sword way,

32:42.000 --> 32:43.370
overlooking all others.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.940
The sword technique you created

32:46.720 --> 32:48.220
may not have been the greatest in the martial world,

32:48.640 --> 32:50.700
but the energy of your sword was peerless.

32:51.400 --> 32:52.370
Now,

32:53.480 --> 32:54.500
the mountains are still high,

32:55.240 --> 32:56.410
but you've grown old.

32:57.000 --> 32:57.740
You no longer live up

32:58.750 --> 33:00.370
to the caliber of your sword.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.300
After today,

33:03.030 --> 33:04.410
Jian Shanyue

33:04.960 --> 33:05.850
will cease to be

33:05.920 --> 33:07.740
in the martial world.

33:10.000 --> 33:10.890
After today,

33:11.720 --> 33:13.300
your position as elder of Lunwu Hall

33:13.920 --> 33:14.890
shall be replaced.

33:15.750 --> 33:17.300
It is time for you to retire and enjoy your later years.

33:18.510 --> 33:19.130
I will

33:20.000 --> 33:21.220
handle this myself.

33:30.200 --> 33:31.220
This is the first appearance

33:32.200 --> 33:34.130
of the Crane Feather Sword in the martial world.

33:34.680 --> 33:36.170
You are a worthy opponent.

33:36.750 --> 33:37.810
When that sword is drawn,

33:38.240 --> 33:39.260
there is none other that compares.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.540
The No-Sword City

33:41.030 --> 33:43.060
was a name I greatly admired

33:43.350 --> 33:44.260
in my youth.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.610
Sadly,

33:45.830 --> 33:46.890
that mighty sect

33:47.680 --> 33:48.780
disappeared overnight

33:49.070 --> 33:50.090
from the world.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.740
A tragic loss

33:52.070 --> 33:52.890
indeed.

33:54.790 --> 33:55.500
Today,

33:55.790 --> 33:57.980
I am honored to meet the Young City Lord

33:58.070 --> 33:59.130
of No-Sword City.

33:59.750 --> 34:00.260
Why not

34:00.550 --> 34:01.300
come with me

34:01.300 --> 34:03.370
to Wushuang City for a gathering?

34:03.830 --> 34:04.540
Why must we

34:04.830 --> 34:05.850
draw swords

34:06.000 --> 34:07.090
here?

34:07.640 --> 34:08.570
Long ago, Wushuang City stood

34:08.630 --> 34:10.290
as the unrivaled capital of martial arts.

34:10.800 --> 34:12.020
Wushuang﻿, "peerless."

34:12.710 --> 34:13.820
But my father used to say

34:14.630 --> 34:15.610
that in terms of swordsmanship,

34:16.480 --> 34:18.090
he was unmatched in the world.

34:19.030 --> 34:19.770
For years,

34:19.770 --> 34:21.540
neither could settle the score.

34:22.760 --> 34:23.690
Today,

34:25.150 --> 34:26.210
I come to fulfill

34:26.230 --> 34:27.650
my father's last wish.

34:28.550 --> 34:29.690
Everyone knows

34:30.280 --> 34:31.340
that Wushuang City has lost

34:31.670 --> 34:32.730
its "peerless" standing

34:33.480 --> 34:35.500
in the sword's path.

34:36.110 --> 34:37.960
Even with the rise

34:37.960 --> 34:39.460
of countless Sword Deities,

34:40.000 --> 34:41.340
today, I seek only

34:42.400 --> 34:43.980
to uphold my father's legacy.

34:44.880 --> 34:45.860
So, City Lord Song,

34:47.230 --> 34:48.340
please offer your guidance.

34:48.840 --> 34:49.860
From his words,

34:50.110 --> 34:51.340
it seems the fall of No-Sword City

34:51.670 --> 34:53.090
and the present state of Wushuang City are intertwined.

34:54.110 --> 34:55.060
This duel is inevitable.

34:55.760 --> 34:56.460
Should I win,

34:57.150 --> 34:58.540
the revival of the No-Sword City

34:58.800 --> 34:59.540
will ripple

34:59.540 --> 35:00.820
through the martial world.

35:02.000 --> 35:02.770
If I lose,

35:03.230 --> 35:04.380
Wushuang City

35:05.110 --> 35:06.380
will lose its title

35:06.380 --> 35:07.610
as one of the Four Greatest Cities for good.

35:09.110 --> 35:10.210
I shouldn't have come.

35:10.880 --> 35:11.690
I've made a mistake.

35:12.670 --> 35:14.090
I used to think my sword

35:14.400 --> 35:16.290
was burdened with too much,

35:17.710 --> 35:19.500
that every strike couldn't be wielded

35:20.360 --> 35:21.610
to its fullest.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.090
It wasn't until I wore this veil

35:25.190 --> 35:26.190
and used

35:26.190 --> 35:27.900
my long-forgotten name, Zhuo Yue'an,

35:28.840 --> 35:30.130
that I felt better.

35:31.000 --> 35:32.020
But seeing you today,

35:34.280 --> 35:35.420
I finally understand

35:36.510 --> 35:38.170
what my father meant

35:39.030 --> 35:40.210
by the "sword that imprisons oneself."

35:41.670 --> 35:42.730
The sword that imprisons oneself?

35:43.670 --> 35:44.820
To be trapped by one's own making,

35:45.230 --> 35:46.250
imprisoned by one's own sword.

35:47.880 --> 35:49.170
You are a good swordsman.

35:49.840 --> 35:50.690
It's a shame.

35:52.190 --> 35:53.020
Yanhui,

35:53.370 --> 35:54.770
you are the lord of a city.

35:55.110 --> 35:56.460
You mustn't unsheathe your sword for just anyone.

35:57.150 --> 35:58.340
Liu Yunqi.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.170
Ashen Dragon Fang.

36:09.030 --> 36:09.610
Correct.

36:10.320 --> 36:11.610
This is the Ashen Dragon Fang.

36:12.400 --> 36:13.570
Once, I wielded it

36:14.190 --> 36:15.130
against your father

36:15.840 --> 36:17.540
for an entire day and night.

36:18.190 --> 36:18.820
In the end,

36:19.400 --> 36:21.090
we remained evenly matched.

36:21.960 --> 36:23.020
But my father said

36:23.800 --> 36:24.900
he had won.

36:25.840 --> 36:26.770
He was ecstatic.

36:28.280 --> 36:30.130
Not because he defeated you,

36:30.630 --> 36:31.730
but because he found someone

36:31.760 --> 36:32.770
who could stride alongside him

36:32.770 --> 36:34.130
in the path

36:35.030 --> 36:36.210
of the sword.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.690
Nonsense.

36:38.630 --> 36:39.860
If he truly won,

36:40.630 --> 36:42.290
why wouldn't he reveal it to the world?

36:43.400 --> 36:44.130
Shameless.

36:45.150 --> 36:46.020
Someone like you

36:46.550 --> 36:47.540
doesn't deserve

36:47.540 --> 36:48.480
to stride

36:48.480 --> 36:49.610
alongside my father.

36:50.710 --> 36:51.420
So be it.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.650
Today, I will defeat you

36:54.360 --> 36:55.820
and cut your sword in half.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.820
For my father, I will prove

36:58.880 --> 37:00.090
that the sword of No-Sword City

37:01.150 --> 37:03.020
surpasses Wushuang City.

37:05.550 --> 37:06.610
No-Sword City

37:06.800 --> 37:07.940
no longer exists.

37:08.590 --> 37:09.650
Why do you

37:10.000 --> 37:11.090
cling to it?

37:11.710 --> 37:12.980
I am still alive.

37:14.670 --> 37:15.540
As long as I live,

37:16.590 --> 37:18.020
No-Sword City still exists.

37:18.960 --> 37:20.690
And the way of the sword my father passed down

37:22.550 --> 37:23.860
shall remain.

37:24.510 --> 37:25.290
Young man,

37:26.030 --> 37:27.170
you're very confident.

37:28.110 --> 37:29.090
You have a fine sword.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.610
It looks like the work of the Villa of Famed Swords.

37:33.070 --> 37:33.940
However,

37:35.110 --> 37:36.420
the sharper the sword,

37:36.880 --> 37:38.060
the easier it breaks.

37:38.800 --> 37:39.420
Yanhui,

37:40.150 --> 37:41.250
you may withdraw.

37:42.800 --> 37:43.340
Master,

37:43.880 --> 37:44.500
I believe...

37:47.030 --> 37:49.610
I've been nurturing my sword in the Sword Abode for many years.

37:50.620 --> 37:51.720
Today's battle

37:52.280 --> 37:53.460
is unavoidable.

37:54.360 --> 37:55.130
If he wishes

37:55.880 --> 37:57.540
to challenge us on behalf of Zhuo Yuluo,

37:58.150 --> 37:58.900
then,

37:59.800 --> 38:00.900
I shall duel him.

38:01.760 --> 38:02.650
However,

38:03.710 --> 38:05.060
by that means,

38:05.800 --> 38:06.980
the outcome

38:07.590 --> 38:08.610
of this duel

38:09.280 --> 38:11.060
will settle past grievances,

38:11.760 --> 38:13.650
without bearing on today's Wushuang City.

38:14.480 --> 38:15.250
Is that agreeable?

38:16.840 --> 38:17.380
Very well.

38:20.190 --> 38:20.860
Yanhui,

38:21.760 --> 38:22.460
step back.

38:24.280 --> 38:24.860
Yes.

38:35.000 --> 38:35.690
I will defeat you,

38:36.190 --> 38:37.020
and I will kill you.

38:37.320 --> 38:37.940
Boy,

38:38.230 --> 38:38.980
watch carefully.

39:28.590 --> 39:29.860
That young man compelled me

39:29.860 --> 39:30.820
to wield my Shanyue Sword Technique,

39:31.480 --> 39:32.650
and I glimpsed

39:32.960 --> 39:35.210
my youthful zeal once more.

39:35.710 --> 39:38.340
But now, his sword has lost

39:38.710 --> 39:39.650
that lofty spirit

39:39.710 --> 39:41.020
and zeal.

39:41.510 --> 39:42.980
It is now filled solely with murderous will.

39:43.960 --> 39:44.730
If this continues,

39:45.510 --> 39:46.380
he will surely lose

39:46.760 --> 39:47.610
within ten moves.

39:49.070 --> 39:49.690
No.

39:50.710 --> 39:51.980
He's trying to use a single defeat

39:52.440 --> 39:54.340
to exchange for the death of the Former City Lord.

39:54.480 --> 39:55.090
He isn't using

39:55.190 --> 39:57.130
the sword techniques of No-Sword City anymore.

39:57.630 --> 39:59.970
He no longer fights with the arts of the true sword way.

40:00.360 --> 40:00.860
He intends

40:01.480 --> 40:02.860
to kill.

40:16.020 --> 40:19.500
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

40:19.540 --> 40:23.420
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

40:25.260 --> 40:28.740
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

40:28.780 --> 40:32.620
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

40:34.620 --> 40:37.900
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

40:38.020 --> 40:40.100
♪Still I can't let go♪

40:40.260 --> 40:43.700
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

40:44.180 --> 40:46.380
♪My heart no longer my own♪

40:46.500 --> 40:51.500
♪No one can escape from love♪

41:08.100 --> 41:11.820
♪How many hidden feelings♪

41:11.940 --> 41:16.020
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

41:17.260 --> 41:21.140
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

41:21.260 --> 41:25.500
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

41:26.620 --> 41:29.500
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

41:29.580 --> 41:33.820
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

41:36.100 --> 41:40.100
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

41:40.140 --> 41:43.580
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

